    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d719">

                <pb facs="0807" n="695" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg695"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Minister Lyon.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1908-06-18"><hi rendition="#italic">June 18,
                        1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I inclose for your information and the
                    files of the legation copy of a correspondence relative to the request made by
                    the Liberian envoys in this country that the United States invite the Government
                    of Great Britain to cooperate with it with a view to assuring the perpetuity of
                    Liberia.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Elihu Root.</hi></signed></closer>








